      <Desc>IN 2024, YAD FOUNDATION CONDUCTED MORE THAN TWO DOZEN VIRTUAL BRIEFING SESSIONS VIA ZOOM DESIGNED TO EDUCATE AND INFORM PARTICIPANTS ABOUT JEWISH HISTORY, IDENTITY, AND CONTEMPORARY ISSUES. THESE SESSIONS SHARED ORIGINAL RESEARCH, PROVIDED EDUCATIONAL RESOURCES, AND FOSTERED DIALOGUE TO EMPOWER PARTICIPANTS TO CONFIDENTLY EXPRESS AND DEFEND THEIR JEWISH IDENTITY. IN ADDITION, THE FOUNDATION HELD AT LEAST A DOZEN INDIVIDUAL DONOR BRIEFINGS TO SHARE VITAL RESEARCH FINDINGS AND TO ENGAGE SUPPORTERS IN THE FOUNDATION'S EDUCATIONAL MISSION. THROUGH THESE ACTIVITIES, YAD FOUNDATION SIGNIFICANTLY ADVANCED ITS CHARITABLE AND EDUCATIONAL PURPOSES BY BROADENING PUBLIC UNDERSTANDING OF JUDAISM AND COMBATING MISINFORMATION.</Desc>
